<title>USA: Hartford Steam Boiler Q4 shr down at $0.57.</title>
<headline>Hartford Steam Boiler Q4 shr down at $0.57.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.57		    $0.81</p>
<p> Net		 11,400		   16,600</p>
<p> Ins premiums    113,500		  99,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  20,100		   20,400</p>
<p>	  12   MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $2.65		    $3.07</p>
<p> Net		 53,400		   62,600</p>
<p> Ins premiums    448,600		  389,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  20,200		   20,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Hartford Steam Boiler Inspection and Insurance Co.</p>
<p>Company said decline in 1996 Q4 net share due to a loss at Radian International LLC from revenue shortfalls and charges incurred from a 10-percent staff reduction in December.</p>
</text>
